notes.content:
Hi!

On the way to the festival "Games Be", in which we took part, and at the very beginning of it we will publish a demo version of the project. Anyone can try it out and add the game to your wish list, so you won't miss the release.
Start of this event on June 16.

At this point the project has a patch 0.1.3, which included the following changes:

1. Enemies no longer walk silently;
2. Character and NPS do not leave traces on the road, as well as changing the sound of steps on this surface;
3. Passing through the bushes, now you can hear the sound of crunching of branches, as well as reduced speed of the character and NPS;
4. The character learned to die. In the demo version is simply thrown in the main menu;
5. The main character, as well as all enemies have learned to run. This consumes much more energy;
6. The game can now be paused by pressing "Esc" and go to the menu, or continue the game;
7. Now, when you start moving (or running), the character picks up speed not instantly;
8. The speed of the hero's turn began to depend on the type of his movement. For example, when idling or walking, he turns faster than when running;
9. The character now reacts to the state of energy and can not run if it is not enough;
10. 10. increased chance of hitting the enemy or the hero from 50% to 66%;
11. fixed some bugs and defects;
12. All admins options for demonstration were blocked (FPS counter, cheats etc.);
13. Carried out a large optimization of the project and sorting all the resources;
14. Implemented volume control of music and sounds in the main menu, as well as language selection and saving settings;
15. Added 20 more home elements;
16. The hero and NPCs now have steam coming out of their mouths.

Recorded a new gameplay video and updated the page on Steam.

Full list of changes before update 0.0.9:

1. Improved blast wave effect, now it physically correctly distorts objects;
2. Slightly increased flight speed of the grenade;
3. Added damage from grenade (both for hero and enemies);
4. changed interface color from black to white (otherwise you couldn't see it);
5. Removed inscription "E" when pointing at an object that can be picked up (got in the way);
6. Added 2 new types of trees;
7. Decorated the first game location;
8. Added new character sprite, which changes if you pick up the gun;
9. Volume of the grenade explosion now also depends on the distance between it and the character;
10. 10. Grenade now loses its flying speed on collision with solid object (i.e. it ricochets off it not as much as before);
11. grenade's hole from explosion now disappears 2 times longer;
12. Replaced the enemy sprite, added the death sprite;
13. Another 1.5 times increased speed of bullets;
14. Added scatter when throwing grenades (i.e. now it does not fly straight ahead);
15. 15. Added sound of pulling the pin before throwing grenade and sound of screaming before death;
16. 16. a sound of bleeding at enemy's death and at his wounds;
17. The enemy will lie dead for 5 minutes, after which he will disappear (let's consider that he was covered with snow).

Very soon we'll put in public access demo version of the game, which can run anyone who wants and try to survive! Stay tuned.
